Dieu 1. Pham vi dieu chinh
Luat nay quy dinh ve giao duc dai hoc, bao gom: to chuc va hoat dong cua
co so giao duc dai hoc; nhiem vu va quyen han cua co so giao duc dai hoc;
quyen va nghia vu cua giang vien, nghien cuu vien va nguoi hoc; quan ly
nha nuoc ve giao duc dai hoc.

Dieu 2. Muc tieu cua giao duc dai hoc
Muc tieu cua giao duc dai hoc la dao tao nhan luc trinh do cao, nang cao
dan tri, boi duong nhan tai; phat trien pham chat va nang luc cua nguoi hoc;
truyen thu kien thuc va ky nang nghe nghiep; tao dieu kien cho nguoi hoc
co kha nang tim viec lam, tu tao viec lam hoac tiep tuc hoc len trinh do
cao hon; gop phan xay dung dat nuoc, phat trien nen kinh te tri thuc va
dam bao quoc phong, an ninh quoc gia.

Dieu 10. Phan loai co so giao duc dai hoc
1. Co so giao duc dai hoc Viet Nam bao gom:
   a\\) Truong dai hoc, hoc vien;
   b\\) Dai hoc vung, dai hoc quoc gia;
   c\\) Vien nghien cuu khoa hoc duoc phep dao tao trinh do tien si;
   d\\) Co so giao duc dai hoc co von dau tu nuoc ngoai.
2. Co so giao duc dai hoc duoc phan thanh co so giao duc dai hoc cong
lap, co so giao duc dai hoc tu thuc.

Dieu 11. Dieu kien thanh lap co so giao duc dai hoc
1. Co du dieu kien ve dat dai, co so vat chat, thiet bi, tai chinh va
   nhan luc theo quy dinh cua phap luat.
2. Co de an thanh lap bao gom: Muc tieu, chuc nang, nhiem vu va cac
   nganh, nhe dao tao; quy mo dao tao; co cau to chuc, nhan su; co so
   vat chat, thiet bi; nguon tai chinh bao dam cho hoat dong cua co so
   giao duc dai hoc.

Dieu 35. Hoc phi va chi phi dao tao
1. Hoc phi la khoan tien ma nguoi hoc phai dong gop de bu dap mot phan
   hoac toan bo chi phi dao tao.
2. Chi phi dao tao la toan bo cac khoan chi can thiet de dam bao chat
   luong giao duc dai hoc bao gom: chi phi tien luong, chi phi quan ly
   hanh chinh, chi phi dao tao, chi phi co so vat chat va thiet bi.
3. Muc hoc phi duoc xac dinh theo lo trinh tang dan phu hop voi dieu kien
   kinh te xa hoi, kha nang dong gop cua nguoi hoc va chi phi dao tao.

Dieu 36. Chinh sach hoc bong va tro cap
1. Sinh vien dang hoc tai co so giao duc dai hoc cong lap va ngoai cong
   lap co hoc luc kha, gioi, xuat sac duoc xet cap hoc bong khuyen khich
   hoc tap.
2. Sinh vien co hoan canh kho khan, nguoi dan toc thieu so, thuong binh,
   liet si, con liet si duoc xet giam, mien hoc phi, cap hoc bong va tro
   cap xa hoi.) Tj\nT*\nET\nendstream\nendobj\nxref\n0 6\n0000000000 65535 f \n0000000010 00000 n \n0000000062 00000 n \n0000000122 00000 n \n0000000195 00000 n \n0000000328 00000 n \ntrailer\n<< /Size 6 /Root 1 0 R >>\nstartxref\n2845\n%%EOF